[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Revenge</h2>
<i>"Nothing is as sweet as revenge"<br>
--Unknown</i>  
<p>Soon after you and some of your allies regrouped and the ritual compleate, the Elemental Clan launched an attack on you.  You must avenge the Duke by destroying them.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
The Duke is avenged! The Elemental Clan is destroyed!  Now to claim the rulership of Nimbus.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron51

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Squire of Rain</h2>
<p>We will show them who's the more powerful.

[ai6TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Squire of Rain</h2>
<p>
My temple is under attack!!

[ai6PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
We must stop them quickly!

[ai6PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Squire of Rain has Died!</h2>
<p>
You were not able to afford to lose yet another ally....You were defeated after your 6th battle.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai7TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
I'm having problems defending my Temple...I need some help.

[ai7PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Squire of Rain</h2>
<p>
Great, just great.  


[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Knight of Wind has died!</h2>
<p>
Forced to withdraw, the Squire of Rain was left behind to perish.  The rest of your allies leave you in fear of more attacks against you.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai8PriestDead]
<h2>A message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Good job my friend, keep it up!

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You have failed to avenge the Duke of Thunder and you have perished also.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]


